.Nd shared telemetry exporter layer for the ObservableBSD tools
.Sh LIBRARY
.Li libotelexport
.Pq Fl lotelexport
.Pp
The library is built as an internal static archive
.Pq Dv INTERNALLIB
and is linked into base-system tools through
.Dv LIBADD .
It is not installed as a shared library.
